      <td width="38%" valign="top" height="109"> 
        <p><font face="Georgia, Times New Roman, Times, serif"><b>PMWATCH</b> 
          -- August 26, 2002 -- Can you spare five minutes of your time per week 
          to push for better media coverage of the Palestinian-Israeli conflict? 
          Are you willing to join us in our push to press for media coverage that 
          is informative, humane, inteligent -- i.e., coverage that respects the 
          basic rules of journalism?</font></p>
        <p><font face="Georgia, Times New Roman, Times, serif">If so, please pledge 
          to call at least once per week a media outlet of your choice on a story 
          of your choice. Enter your email address below and click send.</font></p>
